    {
      "id": "CVE-2026-88032",
      "publishedDate": "2026-09-10T18:02:13.806Z",
      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-10T23:36:07.265Z",
      "description": "A use-after-free in the reactive client-side encryption component of the MongoDB Java Driver can cause native resources to be freed while an affected encrypted operation is still using them when the operation is cancelled. A party able to cause such an operation to be cancelled may cause the hosting application process to terminate. Reaching the issue requires an affected reactive encryption configuration that retrieves KMS credentials on demand.",
      "severity": 5.9,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：MongoDB Java Driver\n🔓 漏洞类型：Use After Free (CWE-416)\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
      "references": [
        {
          "url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/JAVA-6276",
          "type": "reference"
        }
      ],
